@startuml
[*] --> Waiting for a new sale :
Waiting for a new sale --> Adding items (one by one) : Customer selects an item to add
Adding items (one by one) --> Payment (cash or card/check) : All items have been added
alt Cash payment
Payment (cash) --> Sale completed : Immediate payment with cash
else Card/Check payment
Payment (card/check) --> Waiting for a new sale : Payment is approved
Payment (card/check) --> Sale completed : Payment is verified and approved
endif
@enduml
